tarkov-faction-scavengers-desc = Survive through salvage and profitable deals. Recognizing your own is easy; trust must be earned.
tarkov-faction-keepers = Keepers
tarkov-faction-keepers-desc = Try to maintain order among those trapped in the cycle. Shared affiliation helps find partners, but does not prevent betrayal.
tarkov-faction-exiles = Exiles
tarkov-faction-exiles-desc = Distrust the organizers and seek their own way out. Cooperation is a calculated risk.
tarkov-kit-medic = Medic
tarkov-kit-medic-desc = A compact shotgun, medkit, dressings and shells. Save wounded players before final death.
tarkov-kit-assault = Assault
tarkov-kit-assault-desc = A Lecter rifle, spare magazines and basic treatment. A well-armed start.
tarkov-kit-engineer = Engineer
tarkov-kit-engineer-desc = A pistol, steel and tools for repairs, access and improvised defenses.
tarkov-kit-emergency = Emergency kit
tarkov-kit-emergency-desc = Basic equipment to recover after bankruptcy. Traders will not buy it.
